{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_01",
      "hash": "25cbffd4ceb67505",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "唔呵呵……\\n我是玉虹之母……\\c\\n我能看見[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳即將面對的邂逅，\\n以及那段邂逅的未來……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_02",
      "hash": "25cbfcd4ceb66fec",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "接下來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳將會\\n遇上命中注定的對象……\\c\\n要用₽10000\\n占卜一下對方的性格嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_01",
      "hash": "f7d50e445b3313aa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "麻煩妳了"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_02",
      "hash": "f7d50d445b3311f7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不需要"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_03",
      "hash": "25cbfdd4ceb6719f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "唔呵呵……\\n當[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳受到命運的指引後再來吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_04",
      "hash": "25cbfad4ceb66c86",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳呀……\\n最重要的東西好像不太夠呢？\\c\\n最重要的東西……\\n指的當然是錢了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_05",
      "hash": "25cbfbd4ceb66e39",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那麼，\\n請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳回答我一些問題……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_06",
      "hash": "25cbf8d4ceb66920",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳面前有５種顏色的花，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要給哪種顏色的花澆水呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_03",
      "hash": "f7d50c445b331044",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "紅色"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_04",
      "hash": "f7d50b445b330e91",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "黃色"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_05",
      "hash": "f7d50a445b330cde",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "藍色"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_06",
      "hash": "f7d509445b330b2b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "綠色"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_07",
      "hash": "f7d508445b330978",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "粉紅色"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_08",
      "hash": "f7d507445b3307c5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "還是算了"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_07",
      "hash": "25cbf9d4ceb66ad3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "唔呵呵，原來如此……\\c\\n那麼，剛才那５種花裡面，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳想摘掉的又是哪一種呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_08",
      "hash": "25cc06d4ceb680ea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……明白了。\\n那我現在開始占卜。"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_09",
      "hash": "25cc07d4ceb6829d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你和我MEET了……\\n我對他SAY GOODBYE……\\r\\n性格占卜占占卜卜……"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_13",
      "hash": "25cf85d4ceb98e8e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "劈哩啪啦！\\n熱線你我他！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_sub059_poke_01",
      "hash": "efa0f798896ec0c1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……西凱洛～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_10",
      "hash": "25cf84d4ceb98cdb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "今天[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳有機會遇上的\\n命中注定的對象……\\r\\n擁有[VAR ITEM1(0000)]的性格！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_11",
      "hash": "25cf83d4ceb98b28",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那占卜費我就收下了。\\n祝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好運。"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_12",
      "hash": "25cf86d4ceb99041",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不想占卜了嗎？唔呵呵……\\n那也是命中注定的呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub059_poke_02",
      "hash": "efa0f498896ebba8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……西嗯。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_059_max",
      "hash": "e3e37ba718a0fadc"
    }
  ]
}
